          "title": "You'll want to know: отчим",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "отчим (ótchim) — \"a stepfather\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Отчим относился к нему как к родному сыну. Ótchim otnosílsya k nemú kak k rodnómu sýnu. His stepfather treated him like his own son."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
