          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "близнецы (bliznetsý) is the plural of близнец, which is inherited from Proto-Slavic bliznьcь (EtymDB) and shares its root with близкий 'near, close', from Proto-Slavic blizъ 'near' (EtymDB)."
